# The two VERIFICATION logs. tools/build-report.json is tracked on purpose —
# it is the provenance record: which poi-lab commit this was baked from, the
# crop, the derived spawn, the measured sizes. These two are different: they
# are about the machine that ran the checks (wall-clock timings, a headless
# browser's heap, local paths), they churn on every run, and the only thing
# anybody needs from them is the pass or fail that already gated the ship.
tools/verify-report.json
tools/smoke-report.json
